Read(<a>&lt;</a>) events: Start(a) Value[<] End(a)
Read(<a>&gt;</a>) events: Start(a) Value[>] End(a)
Read(<a>&amp;</a>) events: Start(a) Value[&] End(a)
Read(<a>&quot;</a>) events: Start(a) Value["] End(a)
Read(<a>&apos;</a>) events: Start(a) Value['] End(a)
Read(<a>&lt;b&gt;</a>) events: Start(a) Value[<b>] End(a)
Read(<a>fish &amp; chips</a>) events: Start(a) Value[fish & chips] End(a)
Read(<a>&amp;amp;</a>) events: Start(a) Value[&amp;] End(a)
Read(<a>x&lt;y</a>) events: Start(a) Value[x<y] End(a)
Read(<a>&lt;</a><!---->) events: Start(a) Value[<] End(a)
